    },
    {
      "pattern": "Create a provisioning profile to install development apps on test devices\\.",
      "replacement": "创建描述文件，以便在测试设备上安装开发版应用。"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "Create a provisioning profile to install development driverkit extensions on iOS, iPadOS, and macOS test devices\\.",
