    },
    {
      "pattern": "Create a distribution provisioning profile to install your app on a limited number of registered devices\\.",
      "replacement": "创建分发描述文件，以便在有限数量的已注册设备上安装你的应用。"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "Create a distribution provisioning profile to install your app on a limited number of registered tvOS devices\\.",
